01:29:52,976 --> 01:29:55,604
and end this thing .

760
01:30:04,863 --> 01:30:07,783
Thank you , Miranda .

761
01:30:17,167 --> 01:30:18,794
Rachel ?

762
01:30:23,715 --> 01:30:25,717
This isn 't logical .

763
01:30:25,884 --> 01:30:27,803
You 're already dead !

764
01:30:54,162 --> 01:30:56,623
Logic is overrated .

765
01:31:37,831 --> 01:31:39,833
I 'm sorry , Miranda .

766
01:31:51,720 --> 01:31:56,767
So it 's been almost a year and I still have bad dreams .

767
01:31:57,392 --> 01:31:59,811
Sometimes I wake up screaming .

768
01:32:00,062 --> 01:32:01,605
That 's normal .

769
01:32:01,772 --> 01:32:04,358
No , not these dreams .

770
01:32:05,275 --> 01:32:08,028
Everyone thought you and I were crazy

771
01:32:08,362 --> 01:32:10,322
but we were seeing the truth .

772
01:32:10,489 --> 01:32:12,491
More than they could see .

773
01:32:13,534 --> 01:32:16,703
Once you open the door , you can never close it .

774
01:32:16,870 --> 01:32:19,581
Not true . I closed it .

775
01:32:19,748 --> 01:32:21,583
Then I locked it

776
01:32:21,750 --> 01:32:23,544
and then I threw away the key .

777
01:32:23,710 --> 01:32:26,129
I really hope that 's true .

778
01:32:26,547 --> 01:32:29,883
You know , my train leaves in half an hour .

779
01:32:30,133 --> 01:32:33,011
Okay . I 'll get you on your way .

780
01:32:36,098 --> 01:32:40,060
So good luck with your job , okay ?

781
01:32:42,104 --> 01:32:45,190
I wanted to thank you for what you did .

782
01:32:46,692 --> 01:32:48,402
You really helped me .

783
01:32:48,569 --> 01:32:50,571
You helped me .

784
01:32:50,779 --> 01:32:53,073
You taught me how to listen .

785
01:32:53,448 --> 01:32:55,033
Thank you .

786
01:32:56,785 --> 01:32:58,579
We made it .

787
01:33:49,838 --> 01:33:51,381
No !

